<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon’s government received a Metal Shark patrol boat to strengthen maritime security while the national oil company SNH hired a French data specialist to seek investors. An explosion at an iron smelting plant in Cameroon killed four people. The ICC president responded to penalties imposed by the Trump administration in a remote UN address. Separatist activity continues with government forces targeting Anglophone groups, as previously noted. The UCDP recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQONIBY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPQ0lsbVczT1RyWXQxVGRYd3lvbFZnSVBodjFTTE9KUktpT3hyQ1ZPYkFZYnBlZ21vQkVmakNnVmxtQzFSYUlrQk01MHo4RUxhV0ZYc1o1XzBnY2JCd3dRNTJrakphdF9Ua21qVVQxMng1TENlY281ejhNU0NCaFc3QUI1Vk5nWlRpOGgyclZEd21VWWotSFBzMHBLQ3laWTlobUtyMUZkVXljSlpBcVZWckg2M3dtVEFSVTB6bWJiRVlfV1BX?oc=5&quot;&gt;News4JAX&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Devdiscourse&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPWm55ZXFoN2Fmek0zZ25jZzJsbHA3M2NjRkdSZ0dtOHIydlhnN1RDSExZRHd6WTBvdWJtZUo2ZDVRdkhlaUR3MG9vbUhSdk5Iekk5QXdHNjlmQVRYNmVSajFZQlJQZkR2UDhQRzhEVW5vS2ZTdWxCeUp2VUdMN2pGZ0dzUmplWEF2?oc=5&quot;&gt;defenceWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQNm9jNzg4bm9XcEVaRFhPNGZBYWVUOFpuYzVkdFhpMjdJYUpVVTlBMUg3SEc0NEV2Z0FFZDYzUVRSUXRiRkVUbVZKb0RvVkcwLVFabXVQ